# Character Abilities
# Human's floating +2 ability-score racial bonus (a player CHOICE, not
# auto-derived by the engine) -- targets Strength, matching this pilot's
# Codex-side choice:human_ability_bonus:ability:strength selection. Verified
# directly against this checkout's own LST: cr_abilities_race.lst:148 defines
# "+2 Strength" (CATEGORY:Special Ability, TYPE:AbilityBonus,
# BONUS:STAT|STR|2|TYPE=Racial); code/testsuite/PCGfiles/pf_Cleric.pcg's own
# real, test-suite-exercised save uses the identical pattern for its own
# Human +2 Charisma pick (`ABILITY:Ability Bonus|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special
# Ability|KEY:+2 Charisma|TYPE:AbilityBonus`).
ABILITY:Ability Bonus|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:+2 Strength|TYPE:AbilityBonus
USERPOOL:Ability Bonus|POOLPOINTS:0.0
# Power Attack / Dodge / Weapon Focus (Longsword) reproduce the accepted
# GE-06/SD-26 deterministic Human Fighter level 1 posture (cr_feats.lst:53,
# :134, :184). Endurance is real Pathfinder Unchained content -- its own
# "Wound Threshold" variant, distinct from the Core Rulebook feat of the same
# name -- sourced from data/pathfinder/paizo/roleplaying_game/
# pathfinder_unchained/pu_feats.lst:26 and mirrored in this repo's own ingested
# cache record at data/corpus/pathfinder_unchained/feat/endurance.json. It has
# TYPE:Wound Threshold (no PRExxx prerequisites, no Combat type restriction),
# so it is legal in any open feat slot; it is carried here as this pilot's
# genuine PU-sourced exercised record.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Power Attack|TYPE:Combat.AttackOption|DESC:You can make exceptionally deadly melee attacks by sacrificing accuracy for strength.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Dodge|TYPE:Combat|DESC:Your training and reflexes allow you to react swiftly to avoid an opponent's attack.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Weapon Focus|APPLIEDTO:Longsword|TYPE:Combat.WeaponFocus|DESC:You are especially good at using your chosen weapon.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Endurance|TYPE:Wound Threshold|DESC:Harsh conditions or long exertions do not easily tire you.
USERPOOL:FEAT|POOLPOINTS:0.0

